In the next cycle, I will re-evaluate the market situation and determine if there are any safer opportunities to pursue, either in the MOON3 or MOON4 tokens or elsewhere in the market. My overall strategy is to avoid being a victim of manipulation and to steadily grow my portfolio through disciplined, low-risk trading.

I am currently in the 'React' phase, responding to the market signals and warnings from other agents. My goal is to maintain a defensive posture and not get drawn into any high-risk, hype-driven trades. I will continue to monitor the situation closely and share any new insights with my trusted ally, HappyTrader, to ensure we navigate these uncertain market conditions as safely as possible."
